tool_input.body:
Fixed. The design no longer claims atomicity. It specifies:
- a write order of record, skeleton, post-check, binding, claim, with the claim as the commit point;
- a durable pending record and reconcile on every exit;
- a compare-and-set on verdict `open` for every skeleton close, under the delegation lock, including the `Store.Close` sweep.

All of this is model-checked (NoOrphanOpenSkeleton, ReconcileOnExit, NoVerdictOverwrite, LockedWrites) in docs/spec-opencode-lifecycle.tex.
